            <history xml:id="history_191N20112">
               <p xml:id="idm96">The tune was composed for the funeral of L.A.C. Bergmann in Vor Frue Kirke, because Hartmann did not want to use the existing tune. During 1882-1885 Bergmann was headmaster of Metropolitanskolen where Hartmann's grandson, Felix Gade, had been a pupil.</p>
